    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MOLLY: So...what do you think?\nAMY: I don’t know. I’m nervous.\nMOLLY: This is the moment we’ve been working towards.\nAMY: Our whole lives.",
      "MOLLY: And we are the Chinese Club.\nMOLLY: I am encouraged by the progress of our special economic zone in Shenzen.\nMOLLY: We do so much stuff.\nAMY: SO much stuff.",
      "MOLLY: So what are we worried about?\nAMY: College admissions are unpredictable. Thousands of top students are turned away every year.\nMOLLY: So it’s statistically possible that we won’t get in.\nAMY: At least we’ll know that we tried our best.",
      "AMY: Save Darfur! Sign this petition. Get a button.\nAMY: This is important!\nAMY: Karen! Karen!\nAMY: Ryan! Do I - no. I um - do you want to... save Darfur?",
      "DANA: I am super excited to talk about the most important day of your life. Prom.\nDANA: Our lives will never be the same again. This is a memory that we all share, cool people and dorks.\nMOLLY: Our job today is to nominate and vote on prom themes. Keep in mind these should be themes we all can enjoy."
    ]
  },
